{
  "description": "The image-embedded form (Format 14.4): the iTXt chunk with keyword troupe is read whether or not it is compressed; tEXt and zTXt chunks with that keyword are ignored, so they neither hold the bundle nor count as a second chunk; the chunk's language tag and translated keyword are ignored (Format 14.4)",
  "tests": [
    {
      "type": "parse",
      "name": "an uncompressed iTXt chunk",
      "kind": "png",
      "base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAAAAAA6fptVAAAAfGlUWHR0cm91cGUAAAAAAHsidHJvdXBlIjoiMC4xMiIsImtpbmQiOiJidW5kbGUiLCJjaGFyYWN0ZXJzIjpbeyJpZCI6Im1pcmEiLCJuYW1lIjoiTWlyYSIsImRlc2NyaXB0aW9uIjoiQSBzdGFyc2hpcCBlbmdpbmVlci4ifV19ikkFswAAAApJREFUeJxjYAAAAAIAAUivpHEAAAAASUVORK5CYII=",
      "expect": {
        "ok": true,
        "codes": [],
        "equals": {
          "troupe": "0.12",
          "kind": "bundle",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "mira",
              "name": "Mira",
              "description": "A starship engineer."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "parse",
      "name": "only a tEXt chunk with keyword troupe",
      "kind": "png",
      "base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAAAAAA6fptVAAAAeHRFWHR0cm91cGUAeyJ0cm91cGUiOiIwLjEyIiwia2luZCI6ImJ1bmRsZSIsImNoYXJhY3RlcnMiOlt7ImlkIjoibWlyYSIsIm5hbWUiOiJNaXJhIiwiZGVzY3JpcHRpb24iOiJBIHN0YXJzaGlwIGVuZ2luZWVyLiJ9XX3F9aQYAAAACklEQVR4nGNgAAAAAgABSK+kcQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==",
      "expect": {
        "ok": false,
        "codes": [
          "PARSE"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "parse",
      "name": "only a zTXt chunk with keyword troupe",
      "kind": "png",
      "base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAAAAAA6fptVAAAAb3pUWHR0cm91cGUAAHicJcsxCoAwDEbhq8g/F1HHbh7AE4hDbIMGNZa0TuLdRRwfH+9GsfNKDI+mbjs4bKIRHvOlcWc4hJWMQmHL8OMN+fAQIzgoHd84/BU5B5NU5FR49FUuZHmVVLEuosxW45meF+4AJO8LhexfAAAACklEQVR4nGNgAAAAAgABSK+kcQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==",
      "expect": {
        "ok": false,
        "codes": [
          "PARSE"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "parse",
      "name": "a tEXt chunk beside the iTXt chunk is ignored, not a second troupe chunk",
      "kind": "png",
      "base64": "",
      "expect": {
        "ok": true,
        "codes": [],
        "equals": {
          "troupe": "0.12",
          "kind": "bundle",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "mira",
              "name": "Mira",
              "description": "A starship engineer."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "parse",
      "name": "a language tag and translated keyword are ignored",
      "kind": "png",
      "base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAAAAAA6fptVAAAAPGlUWHR0cm91cGUAAQBlbgBUcm91cGUAeJyrViopyi8tSFWyUlAy0DM0UtJRUMrOzEsB8ZNK81JyUpVqAcF2Cole7h51AAAACklEQVR4nGNgAAAAAgABSK+kcQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==",
